Prime Models over Parameter Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0626faf5263e31f8\" href=\"?note=0626faf5263e31f8\" title=\"17-df-omega-stability\">17-df-omega-stability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"086b1b3d5b60a929\" href=\"?note=086b1b3d5b60a929\" title=\"17-df-prime-model\">17-df-prime-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-7.2.3b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为候选参数集合。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_L\">\\(\\preceq_L\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-stability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0626faf5263e31f8\" href=\"?note=0626faf5263e31f8\" title=\"17-df-omega-stability\">17-df-omega-stability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrimeOver}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{PrimeOver}_L\\)</span> (prime-over-parameters predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"086b1b3d5b60a929\" href=\"?note=086b1b3d5b60a929\" title=\"17-df-prime-model\">17-df-prime-model</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L(T)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\n\\land\nA\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak P\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq|\\mathfrak P|\n\\land\n\\mathfrak P\\preceq_L\\mathfrak M\n\\land\n\\operatorname{PrimeOver}_L(\\mathfrak P,T,A)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L(T)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\n\\land\nA\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak P\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq|\\mathfrak P|\n\\land\n\\mathfrak P\\preceq_L\\mathfrak M\n\\land\n\\operatorname{PrimeOver}_L(\\mathfrak P,T,A)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Totally transcendental, hence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-stable, theories admit models prime over parameter sets. The elementary copy inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> is chosen to contain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-omega-stability","status":"resolved","id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-omega-stability]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-prime-model","status":"resolved","id":"086b1b3d5b60a929","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-prime-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-omega-stability","status":"resolved","id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L$ ($\\omega$-stability predicate, see [[17-df-omega-stability]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-prime-model","status":"resolved","id":"086b1b3d5b60a929","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PrimeOver}_L$ (prime-over-parameters predicate, see [[17-df-prime-model]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrimeOver}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L(T)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\n\\land\nA\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|\n\\\\\n&\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak P\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq|\\mathfrak P|\n\\land\n\\mathfrak P\\preceq_L\\mathfrak M\n\\land\n\\operatorname{PrimeOver}_L(\\mathfrak P,T,A)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1979,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language]]\n[[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]\n[[17-thm-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-thm-ehrenfeucht-m